  "Seed for the FUT Draft run rewards (owner design 2026-10-03, todo.md section 2), from FIFA 21's published Draft reward bundles",
  "(fifa21_draft_rewards.json). The server keeps them in the draft_reward_levels, draft_reward_choices, rewards and reward_lines tables:",
  "a fresh or upgraded database is filled from this file once at start-up; from then on they change through the operator panel",
  "(Modes, Draft) and content changesets, not this file.",
  "levels: per mode (online, single) and wins (0 up to draft.json winsToComplete) the level's reward, paid to every run that ends there,",
  "and its choices: one is drawn at the end of the run by weight (equal weights: EA never published its odds) from the run's seed.",
  "Difficulty does not change the reward. Single-player pays less coins than online; both modes' run reward lines are tradeable.",
  "Substitutes for packs the catalogue lacks: Jumbo Premium Gold 26 -> Jumbo Premium Gold (78), Ultimate Loan Player -> Gold (74),",
  "Draft Token Pack -> 15,000 coins. Gold, Premium Gold, Silver and Jumbo Premium Gold are the store's mixed packs (74, 75, 72, 78);",
